        "spot": "floor",
        "text": "Left on the aisle seat, open. ACT ONE, it says, and then a line of dots where the title should be, as if the printer were still deciding. Under that: 'There will be no interval, because there will be no beginning.' The paper is warm. It has been held."
      },
